data/
credentials/
# Wildcards, not bare names: a .bak/.old/~/.local copy next to the real file
# must not slip past an exact-name rule (the profile/photo.jpg.bak incident).
.env*
!.env.example
# Stray copies of secrets/DB/tokens outside the ignored dirs above.
client_secret*.json
gmail_token*
token.json*
*.db
*.db-*
*.sqlite*
*.bak
*.orig
*~
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
node_modules/
package-lock.json
_check/
# Impeccable design-tool working state/cache, not a deliverable.
.impeccable/
# Real personal contact data (name/phone/email/address) — never in git.
profile/personal.json*
!profile/personal.json.example
# Headshot photo used in the CV header — personal image, never in git.
# Wildcard (not just the bare name) so a stray .bak/copy never slips in
# either — caught live 2026-08-21: an untracked profile/photo.jpg.bak sat
# right next to this rule, which only matched the exact filename.
profile/photo*
# Generated CV/søknad docx are personal application artifacts, keep local.
profile/generated/
